      "title": "Sweep Duration (p50 / p95)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (increase(memreg_sweep_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"memreg\", service=\"memreg\"}[1h])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (increase(memreg_sweep_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"memreg\", service=\"memreg\"}[1h])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Sweep duration quantiles. The daemon sweeps only a handful of times per hour, so histogram_quantile over rate(...[5m]) was NaN in ~99% of windows and rendered blank. increase(...[1h]) widens the window past the sweep interval; sum by (le) keeps the quantile correct across replicas; spanNulls connects across the remaining gaps."
    },
