  "title": "Memreg Daemon",
  "uid": "memreg-daemon",
  "version": 1,
  "description": "Memreg capture daemon (:8020). Sweeps are sparse by design — a few per hour — so rate/quantile panels use hour-scale windows. Selectors pin `service=\"memreg\"` as well as the job: only the canonical static scrape job sets `service`, so stale series left behind by the retired docker-sd job cannot double every tile."
